Lu Ziming’s eyes were red, and when he talked about the past, his heart was trembling.
What I cried was that I couldn’t kill him, and I couldn’t take revenge on my own people.
However, before he finished speaking, as soon as he looked up, a man’s delicate face slowly focused in his pupils.
At that moment, Lu Ziming only felt five thunders hit the top.
And in front of him.
He blew the hair on the forehead of the man in front of him.
Mark stood with his hands behind his back, condescending, and his faint laughter was full of jokes.
Just imagine, a person who has been dead for two years, who he was clamoring to kill just now, a ruthless man who trampled on his entire clan, suddenly stood in front of him like this.
However, when this man really appeared in front of him, all Lu Ziming’s pride and ambition were undoubtedly replaced by fear.
“They, I will naturally go back to find them.”
Just now, Qiangqi Qianyun shouted that he wanted to kill himself, but when he actually appeared, he immediately started crying.
“As long as you lend me money, in return, I will help you rebuild the Lu family in the future. When the time comes, you can also continue your great cause of revenge.
“However, you should know that I, Chu Tianfan, are a person with clear grievances.”
See life as grass and mustard, and see all living beings as ants.
“He is the beacon of my Yanxia martial arts, guiding the development of my Yanxia martial arts.”
“Ten years ago, you were just a young child.”
“You said that when you are a teenager, you can’t be a “mortal star fire”?”
Mark’s voice suddenly rose, and at the same time a majestic and domineering power swept out of him.
In a trance, he had an illusion, as if standing in front of him was not a person, but a mountain.
