The first question to ask yourself is what do you prefer: control or power.
It is impossible to have both things to the same degree, although you can have a so-called well balanced racket, which ensures a good balance between the two elements.
If you're just starting out, it doesn't make sense to choose a determined style if you don't yet know what your options are.
They are very affordable and well balanced, which is why they are a great way to get started and discover your style.
